  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Modern FHIR-native developer platform for building custom clinical applications from scratch — the strongest open-source choice for teams who need a certified, API-first foundation rather than a configurable off-the-shelf EHR. ONC Certified (including HTI-4), SOC 2 Type II, HIPAA, CFR Part 11, and EPCS certified. v5.1.11, 272 releases, 2.4k stars, 150+ contributors, Apache 2.0. Production deployments include Ro, Rad AI, Summer Health, and Thirty Madison across telehealth, AI scribe, and population health use cases. Vendor-led by Orangebot Inc. with both self-hosted and managed cloud options.",
